  <item> Complete the table with the amount of one ingredient Diego could have bought given the other. Be prepared to show your reasoning. </item>
</list>
<table class="os-raise-midsizetable">
  <thead>
    <row>
      <entry><emphasis>Raisins (lbs)</emphasis></entry><entry><emphasis>Walnuts (lbs)</emphasis></entry></row>
    <row>
      <entry>0</entry>
      <entry/>
    </row>
